      ],
      "text": "The toolkit is installed into agents via 'npx skills add swapperfinance/swapper-toolkit' and advertises compatibility with Claude Code, Cursor, Windsurf, Copilot, CrewAI, AutoGPT and any framework supporting the open skills standard."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_f68e3fc9817198e49428809fe178d0caca78ea8295accdf2c2b0749680d9df01",
