      ],
      "text": "Repository development practice: CLAUDE.md instructs that the deposit skill builds a Swapper deeplink with a hardcoded integratorId, uses the zero address for native tokens, and that agents must display the full deeplink URL, never auto-approve transactions, surface fees and risks, and never store or access private keys."
